1
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:05,520
所以说 扩散率等于什么鬼
So the rate of diffusion equals something

2
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:08,000
乘以什么鬼的平方根
times the square root of...something...

3
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:10,840
我放弃了
I give up.

4
00:00:11,255 --> 00:00:13,360
就快了嘛
Aw, so close.

5
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,271
给姐闭嘴
Shut up.

6
00:00:14,271 --> 00:00:15,563
别着急 你能学会的
Hey, don't worry. You'll get it.

7
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,160
其实很多著名的科学家都是女人
You know, a lot of famous scientists are women.

8
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:19,000
但都是肥婆 对吧
They're fat, though, right?

9
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,620
走吧 艾丽克斯 要去上大提琴课了
Come on, Alex. It's time for your cello lesson.

10
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,240
辅导得怎么样了
How's the tutoring going?

11
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:24,700
你听说过这么一句话吗
Are you familiar with the term

12
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,260
"赔了夫人又折兵"
"throwing good money after bad"?

13
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,681
你听说过这么一句话吗
Are you familiar with the term

14
00:00:27,681 --> 00:00:28,760
"邓菲小姐 孤独终老"
"Dunphy, party of one"?

15
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:30,480
-这就是你的下场 -姑娘们
- Because you will be. - Girls.

16
00:00:30,492 --> 00:00:32,637
海莉其实学得不错 邓菲夫人
Haley's coming along really well, Mrs. Dunphy.

17
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:33,460
很好 很好
Good. Good.

18
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,340
关键是你要时不时地歇一下
Well, the key is to take a lot of little breaks

19
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,800
这样你就不会郁闷得想要放弃了
so you don't get frustrated and want to quit.

20
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:37,600
明白
Got it.

21
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:38,920
我是在和戴维说
I was talking to David.

22
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:40,420
走吧 宝贝儿
Come on, sweetie.

23
00:00:42,119 --> 00:00:44,340
我只是说 她以后肯定找不到工作
I'm just saying -- she's never gonna get a job,

24
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:47,080
不过没准她能傍上某个中东富豪
and how do we know the right middle-eastern businessman

25
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:48,800
对她很好呢
wouldn't treat her great?

26
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:50,440
我把购物清单落家了
I left my shopping list inside.

27
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:52,349
告诉你 我们计划让她以后跟你蹭吃蹭喝
For the record, we thought she could live with you.

28
00:00:52,349 --> 00:00:54,878
你们别指望能找得到我
Like I'm gonna tell any of you where I live.

29
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:57,900
海莉
Haley!

30
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:00,900
怎么了
What?

31
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,880
我做对题以后才有得亲呢
We only do this when I get one right.

32
00:01:03,761 --> 00:01:04,967
妈咪早该到了
Momma should be here by now.

33
00:01:04,980 --> 00:01:06,100
不会出啥岔子了吧
I wonder what's keeping her.

34
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:08,636
小卡 这就要看她是开那辆老破车来呢
Well, Cam, that depends. Did she take her jalopy

35
00:01:08,646 --> 00:01:10,703
还是开什么新式小灰机呢
or one of them new fancy flyin' machines?

36
00:01:10,713 --> 00:01:12,371
呸 人家密苏里州
You know, Missouri is more cosmopolitan

37
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:13,640
比你说的要现代化得多 米奇尔
than you give it credit for, Mitchell.

38
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:15,800
充满了活灵活现的牛仔田园风情
It's got a very vibrant cowboy-poetry scene.

39
00:01:16,620 --> 00:01:18,440
你上下两句话都不是同一个意思诶
I'm not sure you're making the point that you think --

40
00:01:19,060 --> 00:01:20,980
她来了 过来 热情点 热情点
That's her. Come on. Look alive. Look alive.

41
00:01:22,660 --> 00:01:23,717
妈咪
Momma!

42
00:01:23,717 --> 00:01:24,735
小心肝宝贝儿
Oh, my baby!

43
00:01:24,735 --> 00:01:27,442
亲亲小淘气 过来香一个
Oh, my little bomber. Puppy kiss.

44
00:01:28,163 --> 00:01:29,229
米奇尔 快过来啦
Mitchell, get over here!

45
00:01:29,257 --> 00:01:30,190
巴布 你好吗
Aah, hey, Barb!

46
00:01:30,217 --> 00:01:31,275
我宝贝的宝贝 你好吗
Oh, my baby's baby! How are you?

47
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:36,160
不是我自吹自擂
Well, I don't want to overstate this,

48
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:38,760
不过我妈是世界上最棒的女人
but my mom is the greatest woman that ever lived.

49
00:01:39,080 --> 00:01:40,160
小卡爱死他妈了
Cam loves his mom.

50
00:01:40,184 --> 00:01:41,900
她一人养活了四个娃 俩农场
She raised 4 kids, 2 barns,

51
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:42,639
还有很多其它乱七八糟的
and a whole lot of hell.

52
00:01:42,639 --> 00:01:44,421
听着跟乡村歌曲似的
Well, that sounds like a country song.

53
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:45,940
没错 歌名就是
And that song would be called

54
00:01:45,940 --> 00:01:47,280
"世界上最棒的女人"
"The Greatest Woman that ever Lived".

55
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,960
小卡爱死他妈了
Cam loves his mom.

56
00:02:01,540 --> 00:02:04,300
从我第一次见到巴布起
From the minute I met Barb,

57
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:08,700
她就一直开明 热情 并且体贴
she has been open and loving and -- and caring.

58
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:12,580
我想死你这对小肩膀了
Oh, I have missed these shoulders!

59
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:16,880
不过要是我有任何意见的话
If I had one complaint --

60
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:19,080
说起来我还真有个意见
and I do --

61
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:25,700
那就是 她老对我动手动脚
it's the...inappropriate putting of her hands on my body.

62
00:02:26,060 --> 00:02:29,040
巴布 我买了你做馅要用的小红莓
Hey, Barb. I got you the cranberries you wanted for the stuffing.

63
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:31,760
你太贴心啦
Oh, bless your heart.

64
00:02:34,730 --> 00:02:36,165
我来帮你吧
Let me get in there and help ya.

65
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:40,900
捏捏更健康
And a horsey bite.

66
00:02:42,300 --> 00:02:44,280
我好喜欢这样粘在一起哦
This is how I like to cuddle.

67
00:02:48,066 --> 00:02:49,885
这个现象已经 已经有些日子了
It's been -- it's been going on a long time.

68
00:02:52,180 --> 00:02:54,080
杰 陪我去逛商场吧
Jay, you want to go to the mall with me?

69
00:02:54,180 --> 00:02:55,760
不了 我今天胃有点不舒服
No, actually, my stomach's a little funny today.

70
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,608
这可不得了呀 小宝贝
Oh, I am so sorry, papi.

71
00:02:57,608 --> 00:03:00,280
要不咱先买个婴儿床
Maybe we'll stop first at the crib store,

72
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:02,720
把你放进去 再配条小裙子 好不
and you lay down, and I buy you a little dress, huh?

73
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:05,040
歌洛莉亚觉得我们美国人都很娇气
Gloria thinks Americans are babies.

74
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:08,320
在俺们哥伦比亚 像是小感冒
Well, in Colombia, we couldn't go running to the hospital

75
00:03:08,340 --> 00:03:11,539
或者肩膀脱臼什么的 根本用不着去医院
for every little sniffle or dislocated shoulder.

76
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:18,220
好咧 搞定
Okay. Good.

77
00:03:18,229 --> 00:03:20,850
五比六 我发球 对吧
5-6. I serve. Huh?

78
00:03:23,980 --> 00:03:25,720
杰 你都有什么症状
Jay, what are your symptoms?

79
00:03:26,820 --> 00:03:28,300
恶心 腹胀吗
Nausea, bloating?

80
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:30,400
曼尼 我不是跟你说
Manny, what did I say about getting off

81
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:32,020
少上那个医疗网站吗
that crazy doctor website?

82
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:33,300
我只是担心杰
I'm just worried about Jay.

83
00:03:33,780 --> 00:03:35,400
胃痛可能是多种疾病的征兆
Stomach pains can mean a lot of things --

84
00:03:36,100 --> 00:03:37,060
像是肠梗阻
intestinal blockage...

85
00:03:37,380 --> 00:03:38,160
你发烧吗
Do you have a fever?

86
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,560
够了 曼尼 他好着呢
Stop it! Manny, he's fine.

87
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:42,260
-跟他说你好着呢 -我好着呢
- Tell him you're fine. - I'm fine.

88
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,390
很好 上车去吧
Okay, good. Get in the car.

89
00:03:43,390 --> 00:03:45,580
在家没事 逛街就得发病
Uh, home fine, not mall fine.

90
00:03:45,580 --> 00:03:48,460
杰 你知道我生着气去逛街的后果
Jay, you know what happens when I shop angry.

91
00:03:48,580 --> 00:03:49,540
我会帮你挪出地儿来的
I'll clear a space.

92
00:03:54,220 --> 00:03:55,880
我看你脸色蜡黄
I'm not loving your color.

93
00:03:56,100 --> 00:03:56,820
一边儿玩去
Go play.

94
00:03:58,180 --> 00:03:59,400
别逞强哦
Don't be a hero.

95
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:02,180
弱智男配弱智女
So, dumb guys go for dumb girls,

96
00:04:02,180 --> 00:04:04,000
聪明男也要配弱智女吗
and smart guys go for dumb girls?

97
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,800
那聪明女配谁
What do the smart girls get?

98
00:04:05,940 --> 00:04:06,920
配猫吧
Cats mostly.

99
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:09,420
海莉 我为你们俩的胡搞
So, Haley, how long have I been paying this guy

100
00:04:09,420 --> 00:04:10,100
买单多久了
to make out with you?

101
00:04:10,141 --> 00:04:12,060
大概一个礼拜了吧
Uh, about a week.

102
00:04:12,060 --> 00:04:13,260
我一开始亲他只是想让他闭嘴
First it was just to shut him up,

103
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,440
不过现在我真有点动心了
but now I'm starting to like him.

104
00:04:14,720 --> 00:04:15,880
你要是真喜欢他
If you really like him, though,

105
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,060
就赶紧把迪兰甩了
you have to break up with Dylan.

106
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,840
什么 不要啊
What? No!

107
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:20,260
相信我
Believe me --

108
00:04:20,260 --> 00:04:22,140
早死早超生
and it's best for everybody if you just do it quickly.

109
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:24,760
真不敢相信你们居然这样说
I can't believe we're having this conversation.

110
00:04:24,900 --> 00:04:26,000
他就像自家人一样
He's like part of the family.

111
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:29,280
相信我 这是百利而无一害
Trust me -- it's the right thing to do.

112
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,760
赶紧把他甩了吧
Just end it.

113
00:04:31,060 --> 00:04:32,600
好吧 但是要温柔点
Okay, but be gentle.

114
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:35,960
青春期的男孩都很敏感的
Boys are surprisingly sensitive at that age.

115
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:36,860
又来了 水球女的故事
Water-polo-girl story.

116
00:04:37,071 --> 00:04:38,273
没错 我就要讲水球女的故事
Yes, I'm gonna tell the water-polo-girl story,

117
00:04:38,273 --> 00:04:40,057
因为人家真的很伤心
'cause it hurt!

118
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:43,200
那时候我在校长办公室工作
Okay, so I'm working in the principal's office.

119
00:04:43,460 --> 00:04:44,220
她就那么走进来
She walks in,

120
00:04:44,220 --> 00:04:46,200
头发因刚游完泳而闪闪发亮
hair all silver from the chlorine...

121
00:04:47,380 --> 00:04:49,460
她说她想把棒球外套拿回去
tells me she wants her varsity jacket back.

122
00:04:49,820 --> 00:04:50,749
我一听这个眼睛就湿了
I tear up a little,

123
00:04:50,749 --> 00:04:52,119
接着嚎啕大哭
then I tear up a lot.

124
00:04:52,860 --> 00:04:54,380
我求她 求她不要这样对我
I'm begging, I'm begging --

125
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:55,620
结果我突然发现
at some point I realize

126
00:04:55,620 --> 00:04:56,880
我屁股底下坐着的是
I'm sitting on the button

127
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:59,040
全校广播的开关
to the high-school intercom system.

128
00:04:59,130 --> 00:05:00,600
不许笑
Yuk it up, ladies.

129
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,770
从前不好笑 现在更不好笑
Wasn't funny then, is not funny now.

130
00:05:02,770 --> 00:05:05,276
那完全就是杯具啊 海莉
It was traumatic, Haley.

131
00:05:05,960 --> 00:05:08,760
不要像"大炮"琳达对我那样对待迪兰
Don't do Dylan like Linda "the cannon" Concannon did me.

132
00:05:08,770 --> 00:05:10,690
亲爱的
Oh, honey...

133
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:13,120
都过去那么久了
that was a long time ago.

134
00:05:13,500 --> 00:05:14,460
我真的爱过她
I loved her.

135
00:05:15,140 --> 00:05:16,640
好吧 我知道了
Okay. I know.

136
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:18,620
你知道吗
You know what?

137
00:05:18,630 --> 00:05:20,791
也许海莉跟迪兰分手以后 我可以打给他聊聊
Maybe I'll call Dylan after he talks to Haley.

138
00:05:20,802 --> 00:05:22,550
他肯定需要找个人来依靠一下
He's gonna need someone to lean on.

139
00:05:22,582 --> 00:05:25,829
但那个人不该是他前女友的老爸
But that someone should not be his ex-girlfriend's father.

140
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:27,580
亲爱的 迪兰跟海莉分手以后
Honey, when Dylan is out of her life,

141
00:05:27,620 --> 00:05:28,660
就应该跟咱们都分手
he should be out of ours.

142
00:05:28,780 --> 00:05:30,120
你一向讨厌迪兰
You've always hated Dylan.

143
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:31,420
我没有一向讨厌迪兰
I have not always hated Dylan.

144
00:05:31,442 --> 00:05:33,900
我只是一向认为海莉可以找个更好的
I have always thought that Haley could do better.

145
00:05:33,900 --> 00:05:36,200
再说 这个新男友超聪明呢
Plus, the new boyfriend is so smart.

146
00:05:37,340 --> 00:05:39,180
搞掂了 我们分手了
It's done. We broke up.

147
00:05:39,540 --> 00:05:39,960
什么
What?!

148
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:41,640
我发了短信给迪兰 分了
I texted Dylan. It's over.

149
00:05:42,685 --> 00:05:43,909
肯定是他
I'll bet that's him.

150
00:05:46,380 --> 00:05:47,420
哭丧着脸的表情
Sad-face emoticon!

151
00:05:47,715 --> 00:05:50,013
透过电话都知道他有多伤心
You can feel the hurt through the phone!

152
00:05:54,077 --> 00:05:56,740
吃晚餐时 小卡的妈妈有一半的时间
Cam's mom's been half of the dinner with her hands

153
00:05:56,740 --> 00:05:58,120
都在对我上下其手
all over me.

154
00:05:58,140 --> 00:05:59,620
就好像她是个瞎子
It was like she was blind

155
00:05:59,620 --> 00:06:01,840
然后想知道我的大腿长什么样
and wanted to know what my thighs looked like.

156
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:03,740
你确定吗
Are you sure?

157
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:06,400
你对这种事情真的有评论权吗
I mean, are you really the best judge of this kind of a thing?

158
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:08,680
你从小就对界限模糊
You've had boundary issues since you were a kid.

159
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:09,700
我才没有
I have not!

160
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:11,860
好吧 对不起 是我的错
Okay. Sorry. My mistake.

161
00:06:12,140 --> 00:06:15,320
肯定是小卡母亲的错 是她有问题
Must be Cam's mom...her issues.

162
00:06:16,380 --> 00:06:16,820
你在干吗
What are you doing?

163
00:06:16,940 --> 00:06:18,340
-没干吗 拿个勺子而已 -别这样
- Nothing -- just getting a spoon. - Stop it.

164
00:06:18,380 --> 00:06:19,580
-你觉得不舒服吗 -是的
- Is it bothering you? - Yes, it is.

165
00:06:19,589 --> 00:06:20,839
-嘿 米奇尔 -克莱尔 别这样
- Hey, Mitchell - Claire, stop it! Stop it!

166
00:06:20,839 --> 00:06:22,633
-米奇尔 米奇尔 米奇尔 -别逼我
- Mitchell, Mitchell, Mitchell, Mitchell -- - Force field!

167
00:06:23,711 --> 00:06:25,555
还是那么好玩
That never stops being fun.

168
00:06:25,555 --> 00:06:26,140
很好
Good.

169
00:06:26,140 --> 00:06:28,740
听好了 这不是我瞎想的 克莱尔
Listen, this is -- this is not in my head, Claire.

170
00:06:28,740 --> 00:06:30,340
而且她愈演愈烈了
And it's actually getting worse.

171
00:06:30,500 --> 00:06:31,300
小卡怎么说
What does Cam say?

172
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:33,040
他根本就没注意到
Well, he never seems to notice.

173
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,800
而我肯定不能告诉他
And I certainly can't talk to him about it

174
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:37,760
因为我绝对不能说他妈坏话
because God forbid I say anything negative about his mom.

175
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:40,360
有一次我在她的砂锅炖肉里加了盐
One time I added salt to her casserole...

176
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:42,900
结果他冲进车库砸了我的车
...and he went into the garage and punched the car.

177
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,980
好吧 米奇尔 如果这一切是真的
Okay, Mitchell, if this is happening --

178
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,080
虽然我很确定这是你的幻觉
and I'm pretty sure it isn't --

179
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:46,980
谢谢 你还真是挺我呀
Thank you. Supportive.

180
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:49,900
那么你就要让小卡看到他妈妈摸你
then you need Cam to see his mom feeling you up

181
00:06:49,900 --> 00:06:51,140
然后交给他去处理
and then make Cam deal with it.

182
00:06:52,780 --> 00:06:54,220
好好想想吧
Think about it.

183
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:57,030
迪兰
Hi, Dylan.

184
00:06:57,030 --> 00:06:58,537
邓菲太太
Hey, Mrs. Dunphy.

185
00:06:59,140 --> 00:07:01,100
不过现在我跟海莉分手了
Or, I guess, now that Haley and I broke up,

186
00:07:01,100 --> 00:07:01,828
我想我该叫你"克莱尔"
I should call you "Claire".

187
00:07:01,828 --> 00:07:03,760
还是继续叫我邓菲太太吧
Actually, I think we're gonna stick with "Mrs. Dunphy".

188
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:04,760
进来吧 你还好吗
Come on in. How are you doing?

189
00:07:04,889 --> 00:07:06,384
不怎么样
Not so good.

190
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:10,220
我不管去哪 都能见到她的脸
I mean, everywhere I look, I see her face.

191
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:14,630
那是呀 迪兰 你看的是我们的全家福
To be fair, Dylan, that is a family portrait.

192
00:07:14,630 --> 00:07:16,672
我要上去拿我的东西 可以吗
I got to go get some of my stuff. Is that cool?

193
00:07:16,672 --> 00:07:18,484
当然 去吧
Oh, sure. Yeah.

194
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:22,560
又是她
There she is again!

195
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:27,448
别往书架上看
Oh, don't look on the bookshelf!

196
00:07:27,448 --> 00:07:28,763
那会让你
You're just gonna...

197
00:07:30,860 --> 00:07:31,840
小子 有时间吗
Hey, kid, you got a minute?

198
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:34,467
我要那个医学网站的网址
I need the name of that medical website.

199
00:07:34,467 --> 00:07:36,480
不能等我回家再说吗
Can this wait until I'm home?

200
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,760
我正赢得爽着呢
I'm having the round of my life.

201
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:40,302
我一直在想 我可能有一点
I've been thinking, I might have a couple of those, uh,

202
00:07:40,302 --> 00:07:42,260
你之前说的那些症状
those symptoms you were talking about.

203
00:07:42,260 --> 00:07:42,980
知道了
I see.

204
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:45,120
别等我了 你继续打吧
You might as well play through.

205
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:46,256
我还要耽搁一会呢
It's gonna be a while.

206
00:07:46,256 --> 00:07:47,620
我可能是多想了
I mean, I'm probably wrong,

207
00:07:47,620 --> 00:07:49,480
但是我只是想确认一下
but, you know, I just, uh, want to make sure.

208
00:07:50,096 --> 00:07:52,305
-是曼尼吗 -是工作电话
- Is that Manny? - Work.

209
00:07:53,065 --> 00:07:54,020
那么 告诉他们
So, uh, tell them I'll --

210
00:07:54,020 --> 00:07:55,980
我今天下午就发货 好吗
I'll get that order out this afternoon, huh?

211
00:07:56,060 --> 00:07:57,180
她信了吗
Did she buy that?

212
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,600
因为就连我听起来都觉得有点假
Because it sounded fake on this end.

213
00:07:58,780 --> 00:07:59,980
晚点聊 汤姆
I'll talk to you later, Tom.

214
00:08:01,760 --> 00:08:02,200
是汤姆
Tom.

215
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:04,600
迪兰
Dylan!

216
00:08:04,623 --> 00:08:07,692
迪兰 迪兰 迪兰 迪兰
Oh, Dylan, Dylan, Dylan, Dylan.

217
00:08:08,260 --> 00:08:09,300
邓菲先生
Hey, Mr. Dunphy.

218
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:10,900
你们俩现在既然分手了
Hey, now that you guys are broken up,

219
00:08:10,940 --> 00:08:12,320
你随便怎么叫我都行
you can call me whatever you want.

220
00:08:12,740 --> 00:08:15,040
菲尔 维他命菲 菲老爸 都行
Phil, Vitamin P., P. Daddy.

221
00:08:15,580 --> 00:08:16,200
好吧 菲尔
Okay, Phil.

222
00:08:16,740 --> 00:08:17,180
好的
Okay.

223
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:19,940
我会想念这个臭小子的
I'm gonna miss that bad boy.

224
00:08:20,073 --> 00:08:22,140
有时候我手痒痒了
When I forget my own axe,

225
00:08:22,140 --> 00:08:23,800
就进来拨弄一下它
sometimes I come in here and noodle on it.

226
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:26,860
实际上 我最近也在写首歌呢
Actually, I've been writing a little song of my own.

227
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:28,920
也许我可以给你弹
Might be able to pluck out a few...

228
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:32,020
我一直希望这一切只是个梦
You know, I keep on hoping that this is just a dream,

229
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,700
海莉其实没有跟我分手
that Haley and I didn't really break up.

230
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,720
但这不是梦
But it's not a dream...

231
00:08:36,020 --> 00:08:37,220
除非整件事都是个梦
unless the whole thing was a dream

232
00:08:37,220 --> 00:08:39,460
我们从一开始就没在一起过
and we never even dated in the first place.

233
00:08:39,620 --> 00:08:41,440
真奇怪 这跟我写的歌差不多
Weird -- this is kind of what my song's about.

234
00:08:41,780 --> 00:08:42,220
是啊 真奇怪
Yeah. Weird.

235
00:08:47,620 --> 00:08:49,820
我知道这不好受 但是你会好起来的
I know this is tough, but you're gonna be fine.

236
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:52,140
我高中的时候跟你很像
You know, I was a lot like you in high school...

237
00:08:53,060 --> 00:08:54,280
除了我的头发短点
except my hair was shorter

238
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:55,920
我玩的不是吉他而是长笛
and my guitar was a flute.

239
00:08:58,300 --> 00:09:00,020
如果你想要把吉他
Well, if you want your own guitar,

240
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,012
咱俩可以
I mean, we could --

241
00:09:01,012 --> 00:09:02,166
咱俩可以一块去买
We could go out and we'd pick you one.

242
00:09:02,166 --> 00:09:03,968
我不 这样好像不太好
Oh, I don't -- I don't know if that's such a good idea.

243
00:09:05,680 --> 00:09:06,560
没错
Yeah. Totally.

244
00:09:07,260 --> 00:09:07,460
那么
Well

245
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:09,460
我看我还是走吧
I guess I'll get going.

246
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:11,689
这样一来
So...

247
00:09:11,689 --> 00:09:15,765
我就能 孤独终老了
I can...well, be alone forever.

248
00:09:18,213 --> 00:09:19,673
管它的呢
Uh, what -- what the hell?

249
00:09:21,280 --> 00:09:22,640
咱俩去买吉他吧
Let's go guitar shopping.

250
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:24,020
棒极了
Awesome.

251
00:09:24,432 --> 00:09:27,702
答应我件事 别 别告诉邓菲太太好吗
Uh, do me a favor. Don't -- don't tell Mrs. Dunphy?

252
00:09:27,820 --> 00:09:29,780
那是一定的 没问题
Yeah. Definitely. You got it.

253
00:09:29,780 --> 00:09:31,213
好的 很好
Okay. All right.

254
00:09:31,213 --> 00:09:32,329
那回头见
Well, I guess I'll see ya.

255
00:09:32,329 --> 00:09:33,895
好的 你
Okay. You --

256
00:09:35,103 --> 00:09:37,069
你可以直接
you, uh, you can go ahead and exit

257
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,500
从 正门出去的
through the...front door.

258
00:09:38,820 --> 00:09:40,480
对哦 我都习惯了
Oh, right. Habit.

259
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:45,078
我的旧年鉴
My old yearbook!

260
00:09:45,078 --> 00:09:46,568
你知道我把它们都存下来了
You know I saved them all.

261
00:09:47,841 --> 00:09:49,440
-看呀 -是什么
- Oh, look. - What?

262
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:51,029
你是全校最可爱的男生
"You're the cutest boy in school.

263
00:09:51,029 --> 00:09:52,804
你将拥有一个美妙绝伦的夏天
You're gonna have an awesome summer.

264
00:09:52,804 --> 00:09:55,296
亲亲 布兰达
Smooches -- Brenda."

265
00:09:55,659 --> 00:09:57,520
可怜的布兰达 你将拥有一个
Oh, Brenda, you are about to have

266
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:59,960
史上最郁闷的夏天
the most confusing summer of your life.

267
00:10:01,340 --> 00:10:02,540
大家好
Hey, guys!

268
00:10:02,580 --> 00:10:03,920
米奇尔回来了
Oh, there's Mitchell!

269
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,680
我的小亲亲
My little corn silk!

270
00:10:06,700 --> 00:10:11,260
巴布 你的拥抱真带劲
Oh, Barb, oh, you are such a good hugger.

271
00:10:11,780 --> 00:10:13,920
她的拥抱是最带劲的不是吗
Isn't she the best hugger?

272
00:10:14,455 --> 00:10:15,708
谢谢
Oh, thank you.

273
00:10:15,708 --> 00:10:18,060
看看我给你带了什么 巴布
Oh, and look what I -- I got you, Barb.

274
00:10:18,060 --> 00:10:18,540
是什么
What's that?

275
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,691
是刮奖彩票
Scratchers!

276
00:10:20,691 --> 00:10:22,384
-亲亲 -谢啦
- Mmm... - Thank you.

277
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:23,880
真不错
Nice.

278
00:10:24,460 --> 00:10:26,280
你的茶好了 我去给你沏
Oh, that's your tea. I'm gonna get your tea.

279
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:26,920
谢谢亲爱的
Thanks, honey.

280
00:10:27,260 --> 00:10:28,149
我需要个硬币
Well, I need a quarter.

281
00:10:28,149 --> 00:10:30,100
我来找找看
Oh. Let me have that.

282
00:10:30,100 --> 00:10:32,080
好吧 请随便摸
Oh, wow, yeah, feel free to fish around in there.

283
00:10:32,300 --> 00:10:33,400
小卡 小卡
Cam? Cam.

284
00:10:33,700 --> 00:10:35,080
也给我来一杯 谢谢
I'd like a cup, too, please.

285
00:10:35,160 --> 00:10:35,920
马上就好
Just a second.

286
00:10:36,197 --> 00:10:38,189
巴布 我跟你讲
Ohh, Barb, ohh. You know what?

287
00:10:38,189 --> 00:10:40,591
我 我今天扭伤了
I-I-I strained myself so bad today.

288
00:10:40,591 --> 00:10:42,808
哪里疼
Well, what's hurtin' on ya?

289
00:10:42,808 --> 00:10:45,220
就在 后背下面
It's this area between my, uh, lower back

290
00:10:45,220 --> 00:10:46,160
大腿上面这块
and upper thigh.

291
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:47,800
听起来像是屁股
Sounds like your fanny.

292
00:10:47,820 --> 00:10:48,440
对 就是屁股
It's my fanny.

293
00:10:48,760 --> 00:10:50,420
疼得不得了
It's really knotted up.

294
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:52,315
你得找个医生看看
Well, you need someone to work on that.

295
00:10:52,315 --> 00:10:53,900
我倒是想 只是我疼得走不动了
Ohh, I would love that. Just -- it's really seized up.

296
00:10:53,900 --> 00:10:57,169
我只要你来捏捏
Just put your fingers all over my...

297
00:10:57,169 --> 00:10:57,859
我的屁股就好了
my fanny.

298
00:10:58,060 --> 00:11:00,640
用你的回春之手 巴布
Your magic fingers...Barb.

299
00:11:00,937 --> 00:11:03,104
老妈 你的茶好了
Momma? Your tea.

300
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:04,260
-米奇尔 -谢谢 宝贝
- Mitchell? - Thanks, sweetie.

301
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:05,860
能否借一步说话
See you in the room for a minute?

302
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:07,490
谢谢 茶还很烫
Thank you. It's very hot.

303
00:11:07,490 --> 00:11:09,932
-别烫着舌头 -好的 亲爱的
- Don't burn your tongue. - All right, honey.

304
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:14,840
好吧 我不会哭
Okay, I am not gonna cry,

305
00:11:14,860 --> 00:11:16,220
但是我想知道为什么 米奇尔
but I want to know why, Mitchell,

306
00:11:16,560 --> 00:11:18,880
你为什么在我妈面前表现得跟只狒狒一样
Why you are presenting to my mother like a baboon.

307
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:21,260
我想让你看看她是怎么摸我的
I wanted you to see her fondling me.

308
00:11:21,500 --> 00:11:22,609
看来你就是承心要弄哭我
So, you do want me to cry.

309
00:11:22,609 --> 00:11:23,880
不 不 小卡 只是
No, no, Cam, it's just that...

310
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:26,440
她总是对我动手动脚
she's always touching me inappropriately,

311
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:27,740
而你似乎从来没有注意到
and you never seem to notice.

312
00:11:28,060 --> 00:11:28,940
做给我看 米奇尔
Show me, Mitchell.

313
00:11:29,460 --> 00:11:32,240
用莉莉的娃娃做给我看 我妈摸你哪了
Show me on Lily's doll where my mother is touching you.

314
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:35,220
我知道你不爱听 但是她确实动手动脚
I know that you don't want to hear this, but she's handsy,

315
00:11:35,220 --> 00:11:36,920
让我觉得很不自在
and it makes me uncomfortable.

316
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:39,580
天啊 我知道这是怎么回事了
Oh, my god. I know what this is.

317
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:42,183
我妈太关心你了 你一时适应不了
You're just not used to having a mother that shows affection.

318
00:11:42,183 --> 00:11:43,800
别又把我妈扯进来
Oh, do not make this about my mother.

319
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:44,580
我没有
I didn't.

320
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:47,420
但是跟母亲的肢体接触是难免的
But it is normal for a mother to be physical.

321
00:11:47,420 --> 00:11:49,240
偶尔的拥抱或者
And it is not strange

322
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:52,081
拍拍屁股是很正常的
for an occasional hug or a little pat on tanny.

323
00:11:52,081 --> 00:11:54,800
她不只是拍 小卡 根本不是
Okay, these aren't pats, Cam -- no.

324
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:56,940
她一直揪来揪去不放手
She squeezes and lingers!

325
00:11:57,660 --> 00:11:59,440
跟我示范下她怎么揪来揪去不放手了
Show me where she squeezes and lingers.

326
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,260
小卡 把娃娃放下
Cam, put the doll down.

327
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:06,300
我不知道她是开放还是疯掉了
I don't know if this is just sexual or -- or crazy town,

328
00:12:06,300 --> 00:12:08,900
但是她老是对我下咸猪手
but your mother cannot keep her hands off of me,

329
00:12:08,900 --> 00:12:10,340
我已经受不了了
and it's creeping me out

330
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:12,440
不
No.

331
00:12:13,740 --> 00:12:14,180
巴布
Barb...

332
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:17,577
我给你示范
Let me show you

333
00:12:17,577 --> 00:12:19,873
你在哪捅了我妈一刀
where you stabbed my momma.

334
00:12:22,820 --> 00:12:24,480
谢谢你帮我挑吉他
Thanks for helping me pick out my axe.

335
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:25,648
还有你说得对
You were so right, by the way.

336
00:12:25,648 --> 00:12:27,538
双颈吉他的确是太过了
The one with two necks would have been overkill.

337
00:12:27,538 --> 00:12:29,000
你想吃就吃吧
If you want, you can have some of that.

338
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,000
明天开始节食
Diet starts tomorrow!

339
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:32,020
这也不能告诉邓菲太太哦
Don't tell Mrs. Dunphy about this, either.

340
00:12:32,146 --> 00:12:35,140
我 一直想跟海莉来这里
I, uh, I always wanted to go to this place with Haley,

341
00:12:35,140 --> 00:12:36,358
但是她觉得很傻
but she said it looked stupid.

342
00:12:36,358 --> 00:12:38,400
她为人太主观了
She's a girl with strong opinions --

343
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:39,260
跟她妈妈一样
like her mother.

344
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:41,320
克莱尔总是对我买的这件运动衫指指点点
Claire hates this new sweatshirt I bought.

345
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:42,500
她说这看上去像是
She says it looks like something

346
00:12:42,500 --> 00:12:43,520
女生去沙滩时穿的衣服
a girl would wear to the beach.

347
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:44,400
确实很像
Yeah, it does.

348
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:46,300
但我还是穿了
But I wear it anyway.

349
00:12:46,900 --> 00:12:47,320
明白我的意思吗
See?

350
00:12:47,940 --> 00:12:49,580
我觉得吧 一个人要是不能做喜欢的事
I figure, why be alive if you can't do the things

351
00:12:49,580 --> 00:12:50,580
活着还有啥意思
you're passionate about?

352
00:12:52,180 --> 00:12:53,920
那么你热衷于什么呢 迪兰
What are you passionate about, Dylan?

353
00:12:54,540 --> 00:12:56,840
额 我一直想开车去格雷斯兰
Uh, I always wanted to drive to Graceland.

354
00:12:57,180 --> 00:12:58,768
不错 还有呢
Fun! What else?

355
00:12:58,768 --> 00:13:01,120
我认识一个人能给我搞到一只美洲山猫
I know a guy who can get me a pet bobcat.

356
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:03,560
不行 你根本不知道它们多厉害
Yeah! No, you don't really know what they're gonna do.

357
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:06,640
重点是 你人生道路还长着呢
The point is, you got your whole life ahead of you.

358
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:08,240
享受单身吧
Enjoy being single.

359
00:13:09,140 --> 00:13:10,880
我觉得我应该给你弹一下这首歌
I really got to play that song for you.

360
00:13:10,880 --> 00:13:11,720
我突然来感觉了
This is all in there.

361
00:13:11,880 --> 00:13:12,320
好啊
Yeah.

362
00:13:12,780 --> 00:13:14,640
酷毙了 我马上回来
Awesome. Be right back.

363
00:13:24,060 --> 00:13:25,400
嘿 你 过来
Hey, hey, come here.

364
00:13:26,060 --> 00:13:27,500
那边那家伙是跟别人一起来的吗
Is that guy over there with someone?

365
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,654
你知道他们在搞什么吗
Could you tell if there was anything going on between them?

366
00:13:30,654 --> 00:13:31,237
不知道
I don'know.

367
00:13:31,300 --> 00:13:34,260
好像在说一起去格雷斯兰什么的
They were talking about taking a trip to Graceland together.

368
00:13:35,300 --> 00:13:36,550
他想去是因为
He just wants to go

369
00:13:36,550 --> 00:13:38,611
他觉得那是一个游乐园
'cause he thinks it's an amusement park!

370
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:45,120
我得跟你说
I got to tell you,

371
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:47,540
你这症状越来越像憩室炎了
this is looking more and more like diverticulitis.

372
00:13:47,580 --> 00:13:48,720
有没有说如何治疗
Do they say how to treat it?

373
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:51,168
像是用电热毯或者 又疼了
Like a heating pad or -- ohh -- there it is again.

374
00:13:51,168 --> 00:13:52,760
说说你是怎么个疼法
Well, describe the pain.

375
00:13:52,760 --> 00:13:53,980
就像被捅了一刀
It's like I'm being stabbed,

376
00:13:54,820 --> 00:13:56,720
但又像是被我吃掉的扇贝
but also like I ate a bad scallop

377
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:58,640
从里面捅了我一刀一样
that's stabbing me from the inside.

378
00:13:58,640 --> 00:14:01,300
很形象 但网站上没这些选项
That's colorful, but there's no box for that.

379
00:14:01,540 --> 00:14:02,580
你们爷俩干啥捏
What are you guys looking at?

380
00:14:03,147 --> 00:14:04,768
-看美女 -赫芬顿邮报 美女
- Girls! - Huffington post...girls.

381
00:14:04,855 --> 00:14:07,000
曼尼 让老娘看看
Manny, let me see that screen.

382
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:08,700
我不是叫你不要上这个网站的吗
What did I tell you?

383
00:14:08,700 --> 00:14:10,860
不是他的错 是我让他看的
It's not his fault. I asked him to look.

384
00:14:10,900 --> 00:14:12,900
我开始觉得我的病严重起来了
I'm starting to think I have a serious problem here.

385
00:14:12,900 --> 00:14:14,500
没错 就是这破电脑惹的祸
Yes, you do! That computer!

386
00:14:14,680 --> 00:14:16,300
你看了网页 就开始想入非非
You read it there, you think it here,

387
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:17,180
然后就无病呻吟
you feel it here.

388
00:14:17,280 --> 00:14:18,420
你想好受点吗
You want to feel better?

389
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:21,520
好了 你痊愈了
There -- you're cured.

390
00:14:23,900 --> 00:14:25,400
帮我争取15分钟时间
Give me 15 minutes,

391
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:28,760
弗罗伦斯·南丁格尔女士要是问起来就说我去医院了
then tell Florence Nightingale I went to the hospital.

392
00:14:39,011 --> 00:14:40,970
我要杀了她 我还要杀了他
I'm gonna kill her! I'm gonna kill him!

393
00:14:40,970 --> 00:14:42,480
我要杀了这对狗男女
I'm gonna kill both of them!

394
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,340
怎么了
What happened?

395
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:45,200
迪兰找了个新女友
Dylan has a new girlfriend!

396
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:46,540
什么时候
When did that happen?

397
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:47,440
管他呢
Who cares?

398
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:49,660
他什么都没跟你说么
I'm just surprised he didn't say anything...

399
00:14:49,660 --> 00:14:50,620
奇怪了
to you.

400
00:14:51,860 --> 00:14:53,280
他也不回我短信
He's not answering my texts.

401
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:54,540
他怎么能这么对我
How could he do this to me?!

402
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:56,740
亲爱的 是你把他甩了的
Oh, honey, you were the one who broke up with him.

403
00:14:56,820 --> 00:14:59,120
我没想到他那么快又找了一个
I didn't think he was gonna find someone so fast!

404
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:01,568
可能他比我想的要好
Maybe he's better than I thought.

405
00:15:01,568 --> 00:15:05,060
不 不会 绝对不会
No, he's not. What? No, he's not better!

406
00:15:05,060 --> 00:15:06,129
知道谁更好么
No, you know who's better?

407
00:15:06,129 --> 00:15:08,429
戴维 家教哥戴维
David -- David the tutor.

408
00:15:08,540 --> 00:15:09,480
聪明的戴维
Smart, smart David?

409
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:11,640
可能是他来了
Maybe that's him right now!

410
00:15:11,940 --> 00:15:13,400
想跟他单独相处吗
Do you want the house to yourself?

411
00:15:13,860 --> 00:15:15,080
就一会儿
For just a little while.

412
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:21,180
我收到你的短信了
I got your texts.

413
00:15:21,180 --> 00:15:22,580
你骂得还真狠
You swore a lot.

414
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:23,345
她是谁
Who is she?

415
00:15:23,345 --> 00:15:24,380
谁是谁
Who is who?

416
00:15:24,380 --> 00:15:25,260
你的新女友
Your new girlfriend.

417
00:15:25,660 --> 00:15:27,500
我要她的名字和地址 好去找她算账
I need her name and address, so I can mess her up.

418
00:15:27,580 --> 00:15:29,140
我哪有新女友了
I don't have a new girlfriend.

419
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:30,760
别装傻了 迪兰
Don't play dumb, Dylan.

420
00:15:30,780 --> 00:15:32,840
我没有 我从来不装傻
I'm not. I'm never playing dumb!

421
00:15:32,940 --> 00:15:35,320
我在那个傻逼餐厅看到你了
I saw you at that stupid restaurant,

422
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:38,140
你跟她椅子上的恶心运动衫同吃一个圣代
sharing a sundae with her ugly sweatshirt on the chair.

423
00:15:39,520 --> 00:15:40,669
是那个贱人吗
Oh, is that the skank?

424
00:15:40,669 --> 00:15:43,151
不不 没有 没有什么荡妇
No...no, there's -- there's no skank.

425
00:15:43,151 --> 00:15:44,896
那你为什么不接电话
Well, then why aren't yo answering it?

426
00:15:45,198 --> 00:15:47,140
因为我想跟你谈谈
'Cause I want to talk to you.

427
00:15:47,140 --> 00:15:48,348
我倒是想跟她谈谈
Well, I want to talk to her.

428
00:15:48,348 --> 00:15:49,820
我要给她打回去
I'm gonna call her back

429
00:15:49,820 --> 00:15:51,170
让她把她的爪子从属于
and tell her to keep her hands off

430
00:15:51,170 --> 00:15:52,298
我的东西上拿开
of what belongs to me.

431
00:15:52,298 --> 00:15:54,492
-海莉 -喂
- Haley... - Hello.

432
00:15:55,380 --> 00:15:57,700
-爸 -海莉
- Dad? - Haley?

433
00:16:00,380 --> 00:16:03,100
我的天 那件运动衫
Oh...my...god -- the sweatshirt?

434
00:16:03,100 --> 00:16:04,540
跟迪兰在一起的人是你吗
That was you with Dylan?!

435
00:16:04,780 --> 00:16:06,540
等一下 你就是那个新女友吗
Wait, you're the other girl?

436
00:16:06,580 --> 00:16:07,916
不 我们只是朋友
No, we're just friends!

437
00:16:07,916 --> 00:16:08,520
菲尔 你搞什么
Phil, what are you --

438
00:16:08,520 --> 00:16:10,620
好了 把电话挂了
Okay, put the phone down.

439
00:16:10,740 --> 00:16:12,160
到底是怎么回事
what is going on?

440
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:14,100
他需要一个可以倾诉的人
He needed someone to talk to.

441
00:16:14,380 --> 00:16:16,080
他的心都快碎了
He took the break-up pretty hard.

442
00:16:16,242 --> 00:16:17,724
-但是 -真的吗
- But -- - You did?

443
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:21,760
我一直希望我们能重归于好
I mean, I kept on hoping that we'd get back together.

444
00:16:22,060 --> 00:16:24,500
一想到你跟别人在一起我都快疯了
Thinking of you with someone else just drove me crazy.

445
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:26,160
我也是 宝贝
Me too, baby.

446
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:28,580
但是你爸帮我认识到
But then your da helped me figure out

447
00:16:28,580 --> 00:16:30,393
也许分开才是最好的选择
maybe it's best if we're apart.

448
00:16:30,393 --> 00:16:30,770
好样的
Nice.

449
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:33,520
我只是觉得
I mean, I think I just need

450
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:35,860
我需要一点时间去跟迪兰约会
a little time to date...Dylan.

451
00:16:36,060 --> 00:16:38,480
是说我自己啦 不是另一个叫迪兰的人
And I mean me, not another guy named Dylan.

452
00:16:39,580 --> 00:16:41,660
所以 我们还是要分手吗
So, we're still broken up?

453
00:16:42,162 --> 00:16:43,625
是的 我想是的
Yeah, I think so.

454
00:16:45,560 --> 00:16:51,120
好吧 那就 再见吧
Wow. Okay...um...I don't know -- I'll see you.

455
00:16:53,540 --> 00:16:54,020
再见
Bye.

456
00:16:57,420 --> 00:16:58,640
你没事吧 宝贝
Are you okay, baby?

457
00:16:58,660 --> 00:16:59,800
还要垫多个枕头吗
Do you need another pillow?

458
00:17:00,340 --> 00:17:01,820
我知道你觉得我没事
I know you think this is nothing,

459
00:17:01,820 --> 00:17:03,280
但医生的确说有可能是溃疡
but he did say it could be an ulcer.

460
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:05,000
他还说有可能是胀气
He also said it could be gas.

461
00:17:05,140 --> 00:17:07,900
你想让我帮你拍拍背吗 过来 过来
Do you want me to burp you? Come here. Come here.

462
00:17:08,208 --> 00:17:11,040
十有八九是憩室炎
Dollars to doughnuts, it's diverticulitis.

463
00:17:11,040 --> 00:17:12,420
不是憩室炎
Actually, it's not.

464
00:17:13,345 --> 00:17:14,660
你得了急性阑尾炎
You have acute pendicitis.

465
00:17:14,660 --> 00:17:16,060
我们要马上给你动手术
We need to get you into surgery right away.

466
00:17:16,460 --> 00:17:18,420
紧急手术 我跟你说了不是小毛病
Emergency surgery. I told you it was something.

467
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:21,120
不可能 你得再复查一下
That can't be right. You have to check again!

468
00:17:21,180 --> 00:17:22,240
已经确诊了
The tests are conclusive.

469
00:17:22,420 --> 00:17:23,980
一切都会没事的 普里契特先生
Everything will be all right, Mr. Pritchett.

470
00:17:24,260 --> 00:17:24,780
咱们走吧
Let's go.

471
00:17:25,220 --> 00:17:26,860
不 杰 如果是真的话
No, jay, if that's true,

472
00:17:27,020 --> 00:17:28,740
那我就是全世界最恶毒的老婆了
yhen I'm the worst wife in the whole wide world!

473
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:30,440
我让你忍了整整两天
I made you suffer for two whole days!

474
00:17:30,540 --> 00:17:31,420
亲爱的 没事的
Honey, it's okay.

475
00:17:31,700 --> 00:17:32,808
不 怎么会没事
No, it's not okay!

476
00:17:32,808 --> 00:17:35,560
为什么 为什么我总是差点害死我老公
Why?! Why do I always almost kill my husbands?!

477
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:37,240
我找时间再听这个故事吧
And I want to hear this story sometime,

478
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:39,340
但我现在要准备割阑尾了
but I'm sort of counting down to a rupture here!

479
00:17:39,340 --> 00:17:42,020
不 你不能带着对我的怨恨离开
No!! You can't go without forgiving me!

480
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:43,120
你要是死在手术室里了怎么办
What if you die in there?

481
00:17:43,140 --> 00:17:44,300
没有你我该怎么办
What do I do without you?!

482
00:17:44,380 --> 00:17:45,100
我原谅你了
I forgive you,

483
00:17:45,100 --> 00:17:46,860
但是没人会死于阑尾炎手术
but nobody dies of an appendectomy!

484
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:49,660
没错 通常都是麻醉出问题
True, it's usually the anesthesia that gets you.

485
00:17:49,900 --> 00:17:51,120
你六十多岁了 对吧
You're over 60, right?

486
00:17:51,260 --> 00:17:53,540
我永远不会忘了你的 杰
I will never forget you, Jay!!

487
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:56,460
你还是保持铁石心肠吧 拜托
Could you go back to not caring, please?!

488
00:17:57,260 --> 00:17:58,312
米奇尔 我是巴布
Mitchell, it's Barb.

489
00:17:58,312 --> 00:18:00,423
巴布 我很抱歉
Ohh, Barb. I'm so sorry.

490
00:18:00,423 --> 00:18:01,880
不不 亲爱的 听我说
Well, no, no, honey, you hush.

491
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:02,758
听着 我
Look, I...

492
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:07,060
我一直在想关于我听到的
I've been thinking about what I heard, and...

493
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:10,240
也许我是摸你摸得的有点过分了
maybe I do touch you too much.

494
00:18:10,554 --> 00:18:13,702
我想说我这么做是因为咱们是一家人
And I could say it's 'cause we're a family,

495
00:18:14,060 --> 00:18:15,700
但是 事实上 我不确定
but, you know, I don't know.

496
00:18:16,460 --> 00:18:18,780
我猜我跟你在一起很开心
I guess I have been having some fun with you,

497
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:22,040
我 我以为摸两把没事的
and I...I thought that it was harmless,

498
00:18:22,040 --> 00:18:25,000
但是我从来没想让你觉得不舒服
but I would never want to make you uncomfortable.

499
00:18:25,660 --> 00:18:27,340
巴布 这也是我的错
Barb, it's my fault, too.

500
00:18:27,780 --> 00:18:28,880
那我们和好了吗
So we're okay?

501
00:18:29,100 --> 00:18:30,540
是的 是的 当然了
Yes, yes, of course.

502
00:18:31,220 --> 00:18:32,120
谢天谢地
Thank god.

503
00:18:32,226 --> 00:18:35,580
因为如果咱俩之间有芥蒂的话
'Cause I couldn't live with myself

504
00:18:35,580 --> 00:18:38,560
我会难受死的
if things stayed weird between us.

505
00:18:39,444 --> 00:18:41,240
-小卡 小卡 -怎么了
- Uh, Cam? Cam? - What is it?

506
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:43,340
我们已经和好了 宝贝
Well, we got it all worked out, sweetie!

507
00:18:43,540 --> 00:18:45,200
太好了 我去拿相机
Oh, great. Let me get my camera!

508
00:18:45,300 --> 00:18:47,160
没必要吧 不要
Okay, that's not necessary -- no!

509
00:18:47,280 --> 00:18:50,104
从现在开始 如果我做得过分了
From now on, if I go too far,

510
00:18:50,104 --> 00:18:52,122
-拜托你直接告诉我 -好的
- please, you just tell me about it. - Okay.

511
00:18:52,122 --> 00:18:54,240
那是什么
What is that? Oh -- ohh!

512
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:56,029
差点把手镯丢了
Almost lost my bracelet.

513
00:18:56,029 --> 00:18:59,123
-掉在那还好 -不
- That would be an area that's okay. - No!

514
00:18:59,123 --> 00:19:00,960
-要命 -我来捡 我来捡
- Oh, dang it! - I'll get it. I'll get it.

515
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:02,340
没事 我看见它掉在哪儿了
Oh, no, I saw where it fell.

516
00:19:02,340 --> 00:19:04,220
别逼我 别逼我
Force field! Force field!

517
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,067
怎么回事
What's going on?

518
00:19:06,067 --> 00:19:08,860
-我把手镯掉进去了 -妈咪
- I lost my bracelet in here. - Momma!

519
00:19:08,860 --> 00:19:12,040
听着 我想这种就是米奇尔
Listen, I think this might be one of those situations

520
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:14,760
觉得你做的过分的情形之一
where Mitchell feels like you're crossing a boundary.

521
00:19:16,280 --> 00:19:16,840
是吗
Really?

522
00:19:17,740 --> 00:19:18,780
就像 这样也算吗
Like, this too?

523
00:19:21,105 --> 00:19:24,480
那么 我要好好想一想
Well...I...I got to have a good long think

524
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:26,200
我的行为举止问题了
about how I conduct myself.

525
00:19:27,040 --> 00:19:28,740
我真的很抱歉 米奇尔
I'm truly sorry, Mitchell.

526
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:30,120
没事 没事
It's okay! It's okay.

527
00:19:31,160 --> 00:19:32,911
那咱们赶紧照张相
Well, let's take one quick picture,

528
00:19:32,911 --> 00:19:34,778
-然后我们就出去 -好的
- and we'll get out of his way. - Yeah. Absolutely.

529
00:19:34,778 --> 00:19:36,680
-靠近一点 -这样行吗
- Scooch together there. - This all right?

530
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:37,160
好啦
Okay.

531
00:19:45,540 --> 00:19:46,620
我想他
I miss him.

532
00:19:49,060 --> 00:19:50,720
他是你第一个真正意义上的男朋友
He was your first real boyfriend.

533
00:19:51,580 --> 00:19:53,720
我一直希望他能出现
I keep expecting him to show up.

534
00:19:54,560 --> 00:19:55,860
他以前都是晚上过来
He used to come by at night,

535
00:19:55,860 --> 00:19:57,260
然后我偷偷溜去跟他见面
and I'd sneak out to see him.

536
00:19:57,860 --> 00:20:00,000
-是 我知道 -你知道吗
- Yeah, I know. - You knew?

537
00:20:00,740 --> 00:20:03,840
他开一辆没有消音器的三十年前的旧车
His car is 30 years old and doesn't have a muffler.

538
00:20:04,460 --> 00:20:05,320
他居然还按喇叭
And he honked.

539
00:20:07,380 --> 00:20:08,900
我超爱那台车
I loved that car.

540
00:20:09,825 --> 00:20:12,491
我坐着它去吉他店
I rode in it to the guitar store.

541
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,740
感觉自己快飞起来了
I felt like I was flying.

542
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:20,620
我知道你现在很难过 宝贝 但是
I know it hurts now, sweetheart, but...

543
00:20:20,620 --> 00:20:24,540
这样你才明白这段感情是值得拥有的
that's how you know it was a relationship worth having.

544
00:20:36,288 --> 00:20:38,022
谢谢 爸
Thanks, dad.

545
00:20:55,578 --> 00:20:58,482
迪兰 猫王家好玩吗
So Dylan, you love the Graceland?

546
00:20:59,600 --> 00:21:00,700
是的 没错
Yeah, that's true.

547
00:21:01,280 --> 00:21:03,100
如果他们有过山车就更酷了
Probably would be cooler if they had roller coasters.

548
00:21:04,300 --> 00:21:06,200
不过 能看到国王住的地方还是很有趣对吧
Still, it's fun to see where the king lived, huh?

549
00:21:06,706 --> 00:21:08,700
不 不 不 不
No. No, no, no.

550
00:21:08,700 --> 00:21:11,169
那只是一个比喻 美国没有国王
That's just an expression. America doesn't have a king.

551
00:21:11,169 --> 00:21:19,723
是啊 好呀 什么时候
Yeah. Oh, sure. Uh-huh. When?

552
00:21:20,384 --> 00:21:23,541
并不总是那样的
Well, that's not always the case.

553
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:25,600
迪兰 你有机会
So, Dylan, did you get a chance

554
00:21:25,600 --> 00:21:27,300
听我发给你的歌吗
to listen to that song I sent you?

555
00:21:27,660 --> 00:21:29,960
没有吗 你有七分钟时间吗
No? You got seven minutes?
